## Stack

- Monorepo: `/web` (Astro static site) + `/studio` (Sanity Studio)
- Astro with `output: 'static'` + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS v4 (`@tailwindcss/vite`)
- Sanity as headless CMS; Studio lives in `/studio`
- Primary deploy (production): Ubuntu VM - Nginx + Node (`/server`) serving `web/dist` + `/api/*`
- API surface: `server/` only (Cloudflare Pages Functions retired)
- Not production: GitHub Pages workflow (static only, no `/api`)
- Go-live: `docs/GO-LIVE.md` · acceptance: `docs/ACCEPTANCE.md` · decisions: `docs/PRODUCT-DECISIONS.md` · roadmap: `docs/IMPROVEMENTS.md`

## Languages & i18n

- **Public site (current):** English only — see `docs/PRODUCT-DECISIONS.md`
- Astro / public routing: `locales = ['en']`, `prefixDefaultLocale: false` (`web/astro.config.mjs`, `web/src/i18n/locales.ts`)
- CMS + string files still support `en` | `ms` | `zh` for future go-live; do not add public `/ms` or `/zh` routes until Improvements Phase 7
- `<html lang>` / hreflang today: English (+ `x-default` → EN). Full `en` | `ms` | `zh-Hans` when multi-locale ships
- UI strings only in `/web/src/i18n/{en,ms,zh}.json` - use `t(locale, key)` with English fallback
- **No hardcoded visible text** in components; everything from Sanity or i18n JSON
- When a language switcher exists, it must keep the user on the equivalent page (`switchLocalePath`)
- Localized sitemap for MS/ZH is deferred to Improvements Phase 7

### Translation model (Sanity)

- **Document-level** translations for pages/posts via `@sanity/document-internationalization`
- **Field-level** translations (EN / MS / ZH side by side) for navigation, footer, site settings, homepage chrome
- Each translation has a **reviewed** checkbox; unreviewed content must not be published
- Editors: prioritize reviewed **English** for the live site; MS/ZH are prep-only until Phase 7

## Information architecture (from revamp)

Home · About (Company Overview, Our Team) · Solutions · Industries · Clients · Contact

## Content & page builder (Sanity `/studio`)

Singletons (field-level EN/MS/ZH + reviewed flags): `siteSettings`, `navigation`, `footer`, `homePage`

Documents (document-level via `@sanity/document-internationalization` + `reviewed`): `page`, `news`

Reusable section blocks:

- Document pages: `hero`, `textImage`, `servicesGrid`, `team`, `testimonials`, `cta`, `faq`, `contactForm`, `logoStrip`
- Homepage: same set as `home*` with `localeString` / `localeText` / `localizedImage`

SEO fields per page per language: meta title, description, OG image.

Roles: administrator vs editor - see `studio/src/roles.ts` and Studio README.

Seed CMS content from `docs/content-brief.md` (mission, vision, timeline, OpenText services, team).

## Images

- Every image requires alt text **per language**
- Serve via Sanity image CDN: WebP/AVIF, responsive `srcset`, lazy-load below the fold

## Design

- Brand tokens in `web/src/styles/global.css`: cyan primary `#00B8E0`, lime accent `#C0C820`, navy `#001F5C`
- Flexible layouts (keep room for Malay ~20-30% longer / Chinese shorter when Phase 7 ships). No fixed-width buttons or tight headings
- Self-hosted Latin font (Plus Jakarta Sans Variable) + CJK-safe system stack:
  `PingFang SC`, `Microsoft YaHei`, `Noto Sans SC` - **do not** load full CJK web fonts
- Avoid purple-on-white, cream+terracotta+serif, and broadsheet newspaper layouts

## Preview, forms, SEO (Phase 4)

- API: Node Hono server in `/server` (contact, preview, draft, webhook). Ubuntu: `docs/DEPLOY-UBUNTU.md`
- Sanity webhook → `/api/sanity-webhook` → `REBUILD_COMMAND`
- Contact: `/api/contact` + Turnstile + Resend
- Draft preview: `/api/preview`, `/api/exit-preview`, `/api/draft`; Studio `presentationTool`
- Localized sitemap via `@astrojs/sitemap`; SEO in `BaseLayout`
- Admin ops: `docs/ADMIN.md`

## Access & quality

- Sanity roles: admin vs editor
- WCAG 2.1 AA; Lighthouse 90+
- Prefer semantic HTML, visible focus, skip link, sufficient contrast

## Phase discipline

Build phases 1-5 are complete. Prefer incremental changes; keep a11y/perf targets.

Post-launch upgrades: follow `docs/IMPROVEMENTS.md` (Phase 0 product alignment done). Do not re-enable public MS/ZH without updating PRODUCT-DECISIONS.

Historical build phases:

1. Scaffold, Tailwind, tokens, i18n routing, base layout, header/footer
2. Sanity schemas
3. Connect Astro ↔ Sanity, render section blocks in all locales
4. Preview, webhook, contact form, SEO, sitemap
5. Accessibility, performance, README / admin guide (`docs/ADMIN.md`)

## Astro ↔ Sanity (Phase 3)

- Client: `web/src/lib/sanity/{client,api,queries,locale,image,links}.ts`
- Field-level: `resolveLocaleValue` skips unreviewed; falls back to reviewed English
- Document-level: GROQ filters `reviewed == true`; missing locale falls back to EN doc
- Sections: `web/src/components/sections/*` + `Sections.astro` router
- Images: Sanity CDN via `@sanity/image-url` - `auto('format')`, responsive `srcset`, lazy below fold
- Without `PUBLIC_SANITY_PROJECT_ID`, site builds with i18n fallback chrome/homepage

## Conventions

- Prefer small, focused components under `web/src/components`
- Shared i18n helpers: `web/src/i18n/{locales,utils,paths}.ts`
- Site URL: `astro.config.mjs` → `https://www.jsone.com.my`
